Title: Fixture package B
Author: The pkg-functions authors
Maintainer: The pkg-functions authors
Description: A fixture package depending on pkgfixa, providing one function of
 its own.  A measurement that credits it with pkgfixa's functions has failed to
 isolate the two, which is the defect it exists to catch.
